                    <div class="col-12 col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="prtg-acceptance-disposition">實際處理時間</label><input id="prtg-acceptance-disposition" class="form-control" type="datetime-local" /></div>
                </div>
                <div class="row g-2 mt-2">
                    <div class="col-12 col-md-3"><label class="form-label" for="prtg-acceptance-cost-netiq">NetIQ查證耗時（分鐘）</label><input class="form-control" id="prtg-acceptance-cost-netiq" type="number" min="0" max="1000000" step="any" /></div>
                    <div class="col-12 col-md-3"><label class="form-label" for="prtg-acceptance-cost-native">原生 PRTG查證耗時（分鐘）</label><input class="form-control" id="prtg-acceptance-cost-native" type="number" min="0" max="1000000" step="any" /></div>
                    <div class="col-12 col-md-3"><label class="form-label" for="prtg-acceptance-cost-union">簡單聯集查證耗時（分鐘）</label><input class="form-control" id="prtg-acceptance-cost-union" type="number" min="0" max="1000000" step="any" /></div>
                    <div class="col-12 col-md-3"><label class="form-label" for="prtg-acceptance-cost-combined">合併分析查證耗時（分鐘）</label><input class="form-control" id="prtg-acceptance-cost-combined" type="number" min="0" max="1000000" step="any" /></div>
                </div>
                <p class="small text-muted mt-2">時間以目前瀏覽器時區輸入。預防或尚未觀察案例不得填未發生的事故時間；預測提前量另列、不計實際提前預警。未知時間請留空，不代表該系統未發現。重用相同主機與事故識別會更新該筆查證。</p>
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-secondary mt-2">保存事故查證</button>
            </form>
            <div id="prtg-acceptance-status" class="small mt-2" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>

