            <div id="prtg-disk-verification-batch-results" class="small d-grid gap-1 mb-3" aria-live="polite"></div>
            <div id="prtg-disk-verification-evidence" class="small d-grid gap-1 mb-3" aria-live="polite"></div>
            <section class="border rounded p-3 mb-3" aria-labelledby="prtg-disk-rule-trial-title">
                <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2">
                    <h3 class="h6 mb-0" id="prtg-disk-rule-trial-title">同一感測器規則試算</h3>
                    <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" href="@Url.Content("~/admin/rules")">編輯 disk_free_trend 規則</a>
                </div>
                <p class="small text-muted mt-2 mb-2">以最新完成日的已落地資料唯讀評估一顆感測器；分析窗口依已儲存規則設定，最多 730 日。不呼叫 PRTG，也不建立 finding、案件、交辦或業務稽核紀錄；需先完成語意驗證。</p>
                <div id="prtg-disk-rule-trial" class="small" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">選取感測器後載入試算。</div>
            </section>
            <form id="prtg-disk-manual-form" class="border rounded p-3 d-none">
                <h3 class="h6">人工覆核語意</h3>
                <p class="small text-warning">請先在 PRTG 核對此頻道。提交代表你負責確認頻道確為可用／剩餘空間百分比及方向；系統會記錄操作者與理由。人工確認不會自動啟用規則。</p>
                <div class="row g-3">
                    <div class="col-12 col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="prtg-manual-channel-id">頻道 ID</label><input class="form-control" id="prtg-manual-channel-id" required maxlength="120"></div>
                    <div class="col-12 col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="prtg-manual-channel-name">頻道名稱</label><input class="form-control" id="prtg-manual-channel-name" required maxlength="120"></div>
                    <div class="col-12 col-sm-6"><label class="form-label" for="prtg-manual-unit">單位（百分比）</label><input class="form-control" id="prtg-manual-unit" required value="%" maxlength="30"></div>
                    <div class="col-12 col-sm-6"><label class="form-label" for="prtg-manual-scale">尺度</label><input class="form-control" id="prtg-manual-scale" type="number" min="0.000001" step="any" value="1" required></div>
                    <div class="col-12"><label class="form-label" for="prtg-manual-direction">危險方向</label><select class="form-select" id="prtg-manual-direction" required><option value="descending-danger">數值越低越危險（可用空間下降）</option></select></div>
                    <div class="col-12"><label class="form-label" for="prtg-manual-reason">覆核理由</label><textarea class="form-control" id="prtg-manual-reason" rows="2" maxlength="500" required></textarea></div>
                </div>
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-primary mt-3" id="prtg-manual-confirm" disabled>提交人工確認</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </section>
    <div class="lf-card mb-4" id="prtg-probe">
        <div class="lf-card__header">
            <h2 class="lf-card__title">環境探測</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="lf-card__body">
            <p class="text-muted small mb-3">
                「小範圍資料流驗證」會從已對應主機挑一顆符合白名單的 sensor，讀取昨天一天的 PRTG 歷史數值，沿正式取值路徑寫入並讀回資料庫；只證明 API→資料庫資料流，不證明頻道語意或 28 天趨勢。「完整環境探測」則唯讀檢查全站結構與 API 能力。校準匯出的四卡門檻也不是值型規則啟用門檻；驗證成功不會自動啟用規則。
            </p>
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" id="prtg-probe-flow-start">驗證小範圍資料流</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" id="prtg-probe-start">完整環境探測</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-danger d-none" id="prtg-probe-cancel">停止探測</button>
                <div class="text-muted small" id="prtg-probe-status"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center flex-wrap gap-2 mb-2">
                <label for="prtg-probe-output" class="form-label small fw-semibold mb-0">探測輸出</label>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" id="prtg-probe-copy" disabled>複製</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" id="prtg-probe-download" disabled>下載探測結果</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" id="prtg-probe-download-evidence" disabled>下載去識別相容性證據 (JSON)</button>
            </div>
            <p class="text-muted small">JSON 下載使用後端獨立保存的白名單證據欄位，不從文字輸出尋找標記；未知來源欄位與任意文字不會匯出，缺項及未確認時區會標為 unknown 或 partial，這不代表正式就緒。完整探測文字檔可能含主機名稱、IP 與 PRTG 訊息，分享前請先檢查。環境資源描述的是此應用程式可見資源，遠端資料庫主機規格仍為 unknown。</p>
            <textarea class="form-control font-monospace small" id="prtg-probe-output" rows="18" readonly placeholder="尚未執行過探測。"></textarea>
        </div>
    </div>

    <details class="lf-card mb-4" id="prtg-calibration-advanced">
        <summary class="lf-card__header">
            <h2 class="lf-card__title">校準數值匯出</h2>
            <span class="small text-muted">展開進階校準</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="lf-card__body">
            <p class="text-muted mb-3">
                本區評估校準資料累積量，供調整 CPU、記憶體與磁碟狀態規則門檻參考。四項資料量指標達標不代表逐規則證據已就緒或已取得正式啟用資格，仍須通過個別規則準備度與授權試用流程。摘要模式提供同一完整範圍的統計；需要逐時明細請使用診斷資料搬運匯出。完整與摘要匯出都會讀取完整基線範圍；超過安全容量時會明確拒絕，不會截斷、抽樣或縮小查詢範圍。
            </p>

            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-4">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary" id="calibration-calc-btn">
                    <svg class="lf-icon me-1" aria-hidden="true"><use href="@Url.Content("~/img/icons.svg")#arrow-counterclockwise"></use></svg>
                    重新計算
                </button>
                <span class="text-muted small" id="calibration-status-hint">尚未計算</span>
            </div>

            <div class="row g-3 mb-4">
                <!-- 1. PRTG 值型基線 -->
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <div class="border rounded p-3 h-100 bg-light" id="calibration-card-prtg-value-baseline">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between mb-2">
                            <h3 class="h6 fw-bold mb-0">PRTG 值型基線</h3>
                            <span class="badge bg-secondary" id="badge-prtg-value-baseline">尚未計算</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-3" id="metrics-prtg-value-baseline">
                            <div class="text-muted small">尚未執行判定查詢，請點擊上方「重新計算」按鈕。</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <div class="text-muted small fw-semibold mb-1">門檻現值</div>
                            <div id="thresholds-prtg-value-baseline">
                                <div class="text-muted small">-</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="text-muted small fw-semibold mb-1">補充說明</div>
                            <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0 small text-muted" id="explanations-prtg-value-baseline">
                                <li>-</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 2. PRTG 狀態規則門檻 -->
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <div class="border rounded p-3 h-100 bg-light" id="calibration-card-prtg-rule-thresholds">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between mb-2">
                            <h3 class="h6 fw-bold mb-0">PRTG 狀態規則門檻</h3>
                            <span class="badge bg-secondary" id="badge-prtg-rule-thresholds">尚未計算</span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-muted small">此卡僅重算可信 timeline 的 down、flapping、warning。silent、磁碟趨勢與 CPU／記憶體／磁碟資源時段規則未評估；未評估不代表零命中。</p>
                        <div class="mb-3" id="metrics-prtg-rule-thresholds">
                            <div class="text-muted small">尚未執行判定查詢，請點擊上方「重新計算」按鈕。</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <div class="text-muted small fw-semibold mb-1">校準資料量門檻</div>
                            <div id="thresholds-prtg-rule-thresholds">
                                <div class="text-muted small">-</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="text-muted small fw-semibold mb-1">補充說明</div>
                            <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0 small text-muted" id="explanations-prtg-rule-thresholds">
                                <li>-</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 3. 數值取得量級 -->
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <div class="border rounded p-3 h-100 bg-light" id="calibration-card-triggered-fetch-magnitude">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between mb-2">
                            <h3 class="h6 fw-bold mb-0">數值取得量級</h3>
                            <span class="badge bg-secondary" id="badge-triggered-fetch-magnitude">尚未計算</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-3" id="metrics-triggered-fetch-magnitude">
                            <div class="text-muted small">尚未執行判定查詢，請點擊上方「重新計算」按鈕。</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <div class="text-muted small fw-semibold mb-1">門檻現值</div>
                            <div id="thresholds-triggered-fetch-magnitude">
                                <div class="text-muted small">-</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="text-muted small fw-semibold mb-1">補充說明</div>
                            <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0 small text-muted" id="explanations-triggered-fetch-magnitude">
                                <li>-</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 4. 殘留判定門檻 -->
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <div class="border rounded p-3 h-100 bg-light" id="calibration-card-residual-credential-thresholds">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between mb-2">
                            <h3 class="h6 fw-bold mb-0">殘留判定門檻</h3>
                            <span class="badge bg-secondary" id="badge-residual-credential-thresholds">尚未計算</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-3" id="metrics-residual-credential-thresholds">
                            <div class="text-muted small">尚未執行判定查詢，請點擊上方「重新計算」按鈕。</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <div class="text-muted small fw-semibold mb-1">門檻現值</div>
                            <div id="thresholds-residual-credential-thresholds">
                                <div class="text-muted small">-</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="text-muted small fw-semibold mb-1">補充說明</div>
                            <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0 small text-muted" id="explanations-residual-credential-thresholds">
                                <li>-</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <hr class="my-4" />

            <!-- 匯出操作區 -->
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center justify-content-between gap-3">
                <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-1">
                    <div class="form-check">
                        <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="calibration-summary-check" />
                        <label class="form-check-label small" for="calibration-summary-check">
                            只匯出摘要（不含逐日原始列，檔案小、適合直接閱讀）
                        </label>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-check">
                        <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="calibration-override-check" />
                        <label class="form-check-label small" for="calibration-override-check">
                            仍要匯出（若指標未全數達標，強制覆寫閘門限制進行匯出）
                        </label>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <span class="text-muted small" id="calibration-export-size-hint"></span>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-success" id="calibration-export-btn" disabled>
                    <svg class="lf-icon me-1" aria-hidden="true"><use href="@Url.Content("~/img/icons.svg")#file-earmark-text"></use></svg>
                    匯出校準數值
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </details>

    <details class="lf-card d-none" id="prtg-data-transfer-advanced">
        <summary class="lf-card__header">
            <h2 class="lf-card__title">診斷資料搬運</h2>
            <span class="small text-muted">展開匯出與可續傳匯入</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="lf-card__body">
            <div class="row g-3 mb-3">
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <label for="prtg-export-from" class="form-label small">匯出起始日期</label>
                    <input type="date" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="prtg-export-from" />
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <label for="prtg-export-to" class="form-label small">匯出結束日期</label>
                    <input type="date" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="prtg-export-to" />
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4 d-flex align-items-end">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" id="prtg-export-btn">匯出資料</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="row g-3 mb-3">
                <div class="col-md-8">
                    <label for="prtg-import-file" class="form-label small">匯入 JSON 檔</label>
                    <input type="file" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="prtg-import-file" accept=".json" />
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4 d-flex align-items-end">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" id="prtg-import-btn">匯入資料</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div id="prtg-import-result" class="small mb-2"></div>
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-2">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" id="prtg-import-cancel-btn" disabled>取消本次操作</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" id="prtg-import-status-btn" disabled>查詢保留傳輸</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger" id="prtg-import-abandon-btn" disabled>放棄保留傳輸</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" id="prtg-import-forget-btn" disabled>清除此頁續傳紀錄</button>
            </div>
            <div class="form-text">匯入會將診斷包隔離保存，正式監控資料與判定不變；匯入內容不會搬入正式鏡像。</div>
        </div>
    </details>
</div>

<div class="modal fade" id="prtg-assign-modal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="prtg-assign-modal-title" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <h5 class="modal-title" id="prtg-assign-modal-title">指派 PRTG 裝置給主機</h5>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="關閉"></button>
            </div>
            <form id="prtg-assign-form" novalidate>
                <div class="modal-body">
                    <div id="prtg-assign-device-choice" class="mb-3 d-none"></div>
                    <div id="prtg-assign-host-fixed" class="mb-3 d-none"></div>
                    <div class="mb-3" id="prtg-assign-host-select-group">
                        <label for="prtg-assign-host" class="form-label">目標主機</label>
                        <select class="form-select form-select-sm" id="prtg-assign-host">
                            <option value="">請選擇主機…</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label for="prtg-assign-note" class="form-label">備註（選填）</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="prtg-assign-note" placeholder="例如：手動指定對應原因" />
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" data-bs-dismiss="modal">取消</button>
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" id="prtg-assign-submit">確認指派</button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

@section Scripts {
    <script type="module" src="~/js/pages/prtg-admin.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
}
